sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Alice (TCPClient)
    participant S as TCPServer
    actor B as Bob (TCPClient)

    Note over A,S: Joining
    A->>S: open TCP connection (port 3000)
    Note right of S: accept, start a virtual thread for this client
    A->>S: JOIN alice
    alt username is free
        S-->>A: WELCOME alice
        Note right of S: log "Welcome alice", add alice to the user list
    else username already taken
        S-->>A: ERROR USERNAME_TAKEN, then the server closes the connection
    else username left empty
        S-->>A: READONLY Guest-1 (read-only)
        Note right of S: the guest receives everything but cannot send
    end

    B->>S: JOIN bob
    S-->>B: WELCOME bob
    S-->>A: INFO bob joined the chat

    Note over A,B: Chatting
    A->>S: MSG hello
    Note right of S: stamp with sender name and time
    S-->>A: MSG 12:00:01, alice, hello
    S-->>B: MSG 12:00:01, alice, hello

    A->>S: ALLUSERS (typed allUsers)
    S-->>A: USERS alice, bob (only to Alice)

    Note over A,B: Leaving
    A->>S: LEAVE (typed bye or end, or the LEAVE button)
    S-->>A: BYE
    A--xS: connection closed
    Note right of S: log "Goodbye alice", remove from the user list
    S-->>B: INFO alice left the chat
